  "internal_note": "User James O'Connor (user_id 8, Warehouse Supervisor, Operations, America/Chicago, usual hours 06:00-14:00). Account active, no failed logins, not blocked, VPN access enabled, mailbox 29.7% used. Assigned desktop BL-DT-0108 (Windows 11): disk 78.1% free, no warnings, but reported offline with last check-in 2026-10-11T00:57 UTC, so live state could not be confirmed. Scope not yet known (one share vs all shares, office vs VPN, whether web/Teams are slow). Per KB-015 the next steps depend on that scope; escalate if the whole office is slow or one specific share is slow for everyone. No actions queued. Ticket awaiting user reply; if the device is confirmed offline or the user is on-site with slow shares, re-check device status and consider escalation.",
